### Java API

The new API makes it easy to integrate JPlag's plagiarism detection into external Java projects:

Language language = new JavaLanguage(); Set submissionDirectories = Set.of(new File("/path/to/rootDir")); File baseCode = new File("/path/to/baseCode"); JPlagOptions options = new JPlagOptions(language, submissionDirectories, Set.of()).withBaseCodeSubmissionDirectory(baseCode);

try {  JPlagResult result = JPlag.run(options);

// Optional  ReportObjectFactory reportObjectFactory = new ReportObjectFactory(new File("/path/to/output"));  reportObjectFactory.createAndSaveReport(result); } catch (ExitException e) {  // error handling here } catch (FileNotFoundException e) {  // handle IO exception here }

