[Designated initializers] https://eel.is/c++draft/dcl.init#nt:designated-initializer-list  Configuration - cfg = {.filter = "test"}

[Non-Type Template Parameter] https://eel.is/c++draft/temp.arg.nontype  Constant matchers - constant

[Template Parameter List for generic lambdas] https://eel.is/c++draft/expr.prim.lambda  Parameterized tests - "types"_test = []() {};

